This is a React + Vite app being migrated from Base44 to Supabase.
- Use @supabase/supabase-js for all data and auth operations
- Use TanStack Query (useQuery, useMutation) for data fetching
- Use toast from 'sonner' for all user feedback
- Use existing UI components from @/components/ui
- Use Tailwind CSS for all styling
- Do not install new dependencies unless explicitly asked
- Keep changes minimal and scoped to what is asked
- Never rewrite entire files — only modify what is needed